      "created_at": "2017-10-12T14:54:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Aw, that cosplay vid/charity idea was so sweet, go ALD and Handelabra! I had already been planning buying the game on Steam too the next time it went on sale, so knowing some of it will go to charity too is awesome. :D</p><p>Also, I'm really surprised that Deadline is one of the three easiest to go with Chokepoint and Gloomweaver, and not Baron Blade or Ambuscade. Not at all surprised that Iron Legacy is the hardest, though.</p>",
