      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-10-13T12:22:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<div>Thinking of the Handelabra folks as their own team gets funnier when you realize their personas are a mix of both heroes and villains (albeit villains who eventually act as good for a time).</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>@bolnerap: Yeah, I forgot that tune would be ready soon (which is pretty silly of me since I was there at the darn Twitch soundscaping session for it), and one song would count as \"mini\".&nbsp;<span>Now that I am un-silly, though, I look forward to this because I liked what came out of the soundscaping session and want to see where the end result ended up.</span>\n</div>",
      "post_number": 9,
      "post_type": 1,
