      "raw": "<div>Thinking of the Handelabra folks as their own team gets funnier when you realize their personas are a mix of both heroes and villains (albeit villains who eventually act as good for a time).</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>@bolnerap: Yeah, I forgot that tune would be ready soon (which is pretty silly of me since I was there at the darn Twitch soundscaping session for it), and one song would count as &quot;mini&quot;.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Now that I am un-silly, though, I look forward to this because I liked what came out of the soundscaping session and want to see where the end result ended up.</span></div>",
